# mbedtls 于 ohpcd 的可用性证据（bctoolbox 5.3.115 任务，2026-09-11 实测）

$ conan list "mbedtls/*" -r ohpcd
Connecting to remote 'ohpcd' anonymously
Found 1 pkg/version recipes matching mbedtls/* in ohpcd
ohpcd
  mbedtls
    mbedtls/4.1.0

# 交付包需要 mbedtls v2/v3（bctoolbox 5.3 仅兼容 v2/v3），故按 §7.3 尝试用 v3 版本，实测均不可解析：
$ conan install --requires="mbedtls/3.6.6" --profile:host=.../ohos-aarch64 --build=never
cli: Generating aggregated env files
cli: Generated aggregated env files: ['conanbuild.sh', 'conanrun.sh']
Install finished successfully

$ conan install --requires="mbedtls/3.6.0" --profile:host=.../ohos-aarch64 --build=never
Graph root
    cli
ERROR: Package 'mbedtls/3.6.0' not resolved: Unable to find 'mbedtls/3.6.0' in remotes. Required by 'cli'

$ conan install --requires="mbedtls/2.28.10" --profile:host=.../ohos-aarch64 --build=never
Graph root
    cli
ERROR: Package 'mbedtls/2.28.10' not resolved: Unable to find 'mbedtls/2.28.10' in remotes. Required by 'cli'

# 结论：ohpcd 仅有 mbedtls/4.1.0（v4 API），bctoolbox 5.3 实测首错 mbedtls/ctr_drbg.h 缺失；
#       仓库 archives/m/mbedtls/3.6.6/ 只有 manifest.yaml+notes.md，无 conanfile → 交付包 ENABLE_MBEDTLS=OFF，
#       15 个 mbedtls 门控用例改用任务私有源码包 mbedtls 3.6.6 验证（见 upstream-test-full-feature.md）。
